<title>USA: Columbia SD, Mo., won by Stern Brothers.</title>
<headline>Columbia SD, Mo., won by Stern Brothers.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stern Brothers &amp; Co said it won $7.750 million of Columbia School District, Mo., general obligation school building bonds, Series 1997A, with a net interest cost of 4.717 percent.</p>
</text>
